{"version":1,"content":"<p>「渣打香港馬拉松2027」將於明年1月17日舉行，主辦單位中國香港田徑總會今（15日）表示，主賽事錄得逾14萬人報名，數量為歷屆最高。</p><p>於主賽事前一日舉辦的「五公里海濱跑」及「躍動少年跑」將於下星期二（20日）開始接受網上報名，其中「五公里海濱跑」的名額將由3000個增加至4500個。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T10:39:39.806525+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:17:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T12:37:36.568269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T10:37:36.435152+00:00","content_hash":"b21ab00ceadec4434157c389ccdd45b487f7cfaafe3e20c1d921a6db2d9993a9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}